<p>I think the conprocs suffer from the fact that I wrote them before I really decided how I wanted to end this thing and then I never revisited them. I'm gonna take a look and see what I can do regarding how we deal with the animals.</p>
<p>As for the dialogue, I'll play around with it, but my intentions were that these were just some beater small town cops fucking around and not taking this all that seriously until the situation got real messy. I'll see about giving them more personality than just a northeast accent though, because that's a mega valid complaint.</p>

